  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_e330a82359b141a9b3c79a1b803d13df",
      "statement": "The application uses a three-layer architecture: Templates (disposable HTML+CSS skin), Components (Angular signal-based glue), and @restheart-cloud/kit (plain TypeScript portable layer that handles all HTTP calls, token storage, and session logic).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/app/app.config.ts",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:78e49d9b22e83b4211c1250dac93250e8d379b69b06a48c7c0df2267769b806e"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/app/app.ts",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:179547a50d292d51507e396128a184d444c57813a03caaf9a402f0951f3849a5"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_0d94f6e6df18496986bdcc580ea778e3",
      "statement": "The @restheart-cloud/kit-ng package bridges kit and Angular by providing RhAuthService (reactive state), authGuard/publicGuard, and an HTTP interceptor that attaches the bearer token and clears the session on 401/expiry.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/app/app.config.ts#L3-L3",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:ba5ab5096269d4ca157eb3375d3bd5e3628f51f9008c3cfaaf18b18fc30e3f5e:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/app/app.routes.ts#L2-L2",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:73dcc3644da3ba2f1cf6ac46bcf7568692633ecc30dfa95ebdd2abbee89fb623:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_a42c800819834d03bf3ca6e89a4acef7",
      "statement": "Routes declare their SSR render mode in app.routes.server.ts: auth pages (login, signup, forgot-password, reset-password) use Prerender mode, while authenticated routes, verify, and invitations/accept use Client mode because they require live API calls or the in-memory token.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/app/app.routes.server.ts",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:7f2e8af4c12002a5dca807757cb23798a4cda41447b25cf290787696cb7d33f1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_2c34802a178f42f299fce4f31e234bf3",
      "statement": "The SSR entry point is src/server.ts, an Express 5 app that serves static files from /browser and delegates all other requests to AngularNodeAppEngine, listening on PORT or defaulting to 4000.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/server.ts",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:bd5c8bf370c151cc709145d6409433381f2cc6a1f3388bc3a4e1001326851ac7"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_1f2f0a5bce814c7b8d28edb143cf4468",
      "statement": "The server bootstrap is src/main.server.ts which calls bootstrapApplication(App, config, context) using a merged config from app.config.server.ts that layers provideServerRendering(withRoutes(serverRoutes)) on top of the client appConfig.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/app/app.config.server.ts",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:115e541200ba96c75d9e45313d99b2344b3fe8cf5601c864eda7d2b79a342ecb"
