    {
      "id": "claim_3ea5e8852529465999c1cbc678ac3772",
      "statement": "The bootstrap flow starts with main.ts calling bootstrapApplication with appConfig, which calls provideRhAuth with apiBaseUrl and the consentsOnError handler, then the App component checks apiUrl validity and calls consumeFragmentToken on browser load before route guards execute.",
