    {
      "id": "claim_5523fcb9e932451980dc6014c97a1f06",
      "statement": "The bearer token has a 15-minute TTL, scheduleRefresh() from kit silently renews it at ~80% (~12 minutes), the HTTP interceptor attaches it to all API calls, and on 401/expiry the interceptor clears the session.",
