    {
      "id": "claim_ef520b630b9843c395279c5402882a19",
      "statement": "A server-side Guards rule blocks every API request from a user who has not accepted the current Terms of Service and Privacy Policy, returning HTTP 451. Because /users/me is blocked, session restoration trips the gate on first load.",
