      "statement": "The consents mechanism has three parts: consents.ts exports a consentsBlocked signal and consentsOnError function that sets it on 451; consents-gate.ts is a component placed outside and before router-outlet in app.html that shows a modal overlay; and app.config.ts wires consentsOnError into provideRhAuth's onError callback.",
